  moveName: Lightning Blitz
  description: "Become unstoppable and rush for 3.5s, bouncing off walls. Movement
    input slightly steers the rush. Enemies crossed take damage and are slowed by
    20% for 2s; the same enemy can be damaged again after 0.7s. At the end, gain
    a shield worth 20% of maximum HP and 80% movement speed for 6s. Volt Absorb
    remains full and is not spent for the next 5s. Unite energy is spent when the
    rush begins. Death ends the rush and clears overcharge."
